From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TBI Lab runtime <runtime@tbi-lab.local>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] hw/misc/tbi_bridge: TBI Lab synchronous runtime bridge

Connects the classic ESP32 GPIO pads and UART0 to one host process over a
private blocking unix-domain stream socket (syncpath=<absolute path>), so
the runtime needs no network access. Every exchange runs on the raising thread
under the BQL, so host responses apply at zero elapsed virtual time.
Fails closed with distinct exit statuses on protocol errors (3) and host
connection loss (4).
---
 hw/misc/meson.build  |   3 +-
 hw/misc/tbi_bridge.c | 379 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 381 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 hw/misc/tbi_bridge.c

diff --git a/hw/misc/meson.build b/hw/misc/meson.build
index 4c2b5b3..c811a86 100644
--- a/hw/misc/meson.build
+++ b/hw/misc/meson.build
@@ -145,7 +145,8 @@ system_ss.add(when: 'CONFIG_XTENSA_ESP32', if_true: files(
   'esp32_aes.c',
   'esp32_ledc.c',
   'esp32_flash_enc.c',
-  'ssi_psram.c'
+  'ssi_psram.c',
